      "widgets_values": [
        "## Portrait Photography\n\n### 1. Athletic Elderly Man - Sports Documentary Style\n```\nCinematic portrait photograph of a czech elderly hippie man at marathon finish line, muscular and athletic build with pronounced definition, full thick beard and handlebar moustache, extremely long messy wet hair plastered to his face and shoulders from intense exertion, visible sweat stains on his vintage 1970s Olympic-style athletic wear with faded national colors, triumphant winning expression with arms raised, simple neutral background with soft bokeh, shot on 35mm film camera with 50mm f/1.8 lens creating shallow depth of field, professional sports photography composition, visible film grain texture, 4K scan quality, highly detailed skin texture showing every wrinkle and age line, dramatic side lighting emphasizing muscular definition, photorealistic rendering, raw unprocessed aesthetic\n```"
      ],
